  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Back at the studio, veteran actresses whisper skeptically about Muranishi shooting alone with the newcomer, while she tells Muranishi how grateful she is to have escaped her monotonous former life.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "今日も二人っきりで撮影なんですか？あれホントに撮影してんの？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "黒ちゃんの代わりのつもりかね。代わりになんないっしょ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "昨日ね、お買い物してたら昔の同僚とたまたま会ったんです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "美容部員の時の？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "そう。その子、私が出たこと知ってたんです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "何を言われても気にすることはない。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "気にしてないです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "出会わなかったら、まだあそこで働いてたのかなって思っちゃったんです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "電車から見てた色のない景色とか、同じ予定だらけの手帳とか。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "あそこから抜け出して本当に自由になれるんだったら、何でもよかったの。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "そうか。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "だから今は楽しいの。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "今日も二人っきりで撮影なんですか？あれホントに撮影してんの？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Are the two of them filming alone again today? Are they even actually shooting?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "黒ちゃんの代わりのつもりかね。代わりになんないっしょ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Is she supposed to be Kuroki's replacement? No way she can replace her.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "昨日ね、お買い物してたら昔の同僚とたまたま会ったんです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yesterday while I was out shopping, I bumped into an old coworker by chance.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "美容部員の時の？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'From when you worked at the cosmetics counter?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "そう。その子、私が出たこと知ってたんです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yes. She already knew that I had appeared in adult videos.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "何を言われても気にすることはない。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No matter what anyone says, there's no need to let it bother you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "気にしてないです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It doesn't bother me at all.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "出会わなかったら、まだあそこで働いてたのかなって思っちゃったんです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I just thought that if I hadn't found your work back then, I'd probably still be working there.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "電車から見てた色のない景色とか、同じ予定だらけの手帳とか。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The colorless scenery from the commuter train, and a planner filled with the same routine...'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "あそこから抜け出して本当に自由になれるんだったら、何でもよかったの。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Back then, anything was fine as long as it got me out of there and made me truly free.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "そうか。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I see.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "だから今は楽しいの。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That's why right now I'm having so much fun.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
